,"d":"2024-12-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bill Brundage","x":"We’re starting to see as we turn into the calendar year some more traditional returns to price increase announcements, so we would expect our finished goods pricing, which again is about 85% of our overall revenue, we would expect that to inflect positive as we move through the second half of the…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/02/ferguson-ferg-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FERG 2025 Q1","e":"ferg","d":"2024-12-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bill Brundage","x":"Now if the market and the environment turns dramatically against what we’re expecting, if volumes turn negative, if the markets get worse, we’ll take different cost cutting and cost reduction actions, but we don’t expect that today and we are continuing to invest as we move through the fiscal year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/02/ferguson-ferg-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FERG 2025 Q1","e":"ferg","d":"2024-12-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kevin Murphy","x":"…look at the partnerships that we have with our branded suppliers, making sure that we can take cost out of the supply chain such that we can grow our gross margins, when we sell through that product strategy to the contractor while enhancing their productivity, that’s the best long term…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/02/ferguson-ferg-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FERG 2025 Q2","e":"ferg","d":"2025-03-11","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Kevin Murphy","x":"When you look at the tariff impact, that certainly will have some degree of a stabilizing effect on what that deflation looks like.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/02/ferguson-ferg-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FERG 2025 Q2","e":"ferg","d":"2025-03-11","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bill Brundage","x":"As Kevin just alluded to, we've seen some announcements of price increases largely on the backs of tariff announcements.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/02/ferguson-ferg-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FERG 2025 Q2","e":"ferg","d":"2025-03-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kevin Murphy","x":"And if you think about the steel market and what we're seeing in price increases that have already been announced in the steel pipe side of the business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/02/ferguson-ferg-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FERG 2025 Q2","e":"ferg","d":"2025-03-11","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kevin Murphy","x":"And when you think about the finished goods side, we're still fairly early in the year in terms of what those annual price increases look like.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/02/ferguson-ferg-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FERG 2025 Q3","e":"ferg","d":"2025-06-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bill Brundage","x":"It is still a very uncertain environment, and there are a lot of factors out there that are out of our control in terms of tariff announcements and price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/06/03/ferguson-ferg-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FERG 2025 Q3","e":"ferg","d":"2025-06-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Kevin Murphy","x":"And there is no singular response to how a vendor is going to be approaching both the tariff landscape as well as the overall pricing landscape.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/06/03/ferguson-ferg-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FERG 2025 Q3","e":"ferg","d":"2025-06-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kevin Murphy","x":"And as we suggested last quarter, the industry was moving back to an annual price increase environment, and we knew that was going to happen, and we saw that play through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/06/03/ferguson-ferg-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FERG 2025 Q3","e":"ferg","d":"2025-06-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kevin Murphy","x":"And so the industry was moving back to annual price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/06/03/ferguson-ferg-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FERG 2025 Q3","e":"ferg","d":"2025-06-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kevin Murphy","x":"Strong volume growth, gross margin improvement, moderating deflation and the early benefits of streamlining our business drove profitable growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/06/03/ferguson-ferg-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FERG 2025 Q3","e":"ferg","d":"2025-06-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bill Brundage","x":"As we discussed in the second quarter, we took targeted actions to streamline operations, enhance speed and efficiency to better serve our customers and drive further profitable growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/06/03/ferguson-ferg-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FERG 2025 Q4","e":"ferg","d":"2025-09-16","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bill Brundage","x":"We saw that step-up a bit with initial announcements of tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/02/ferguson-ferg-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FERG 2025 Q4","e":"ferg","d":"2025-09-16","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Bill Brundage","x":"We have seen with -- as steel tariffs came through, we have seen steel pipe, carbon steel and stainless steel move back towards flattish, maybe up a little bit.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/02/ferguson-ferg-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FERG 2025 Q4","e":"ferg","d":"2025-09-16","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bill Brundage","x":"Gross margin of 31.7% increased 70 basis points over last year, driven by our associates' strong execution and the timing and extent of supplier price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/02/ferguson-ferg-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FERG 2025 Q4","e":"ferg","d":"2025-09-16","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bill Brundage","x":"As we've talked about over the last couple of quarters, we came into this year expecting our suppliers and the industry to return to, call it, low single-digit inflation and passing through annualized price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/02/ferguson-ferg-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FERG 2025 Q4","e":"ferg","d":"2025-09-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kevin Murphy","x":"The actions we took to streamline our business and manage costs more diligently resulted in operating profit of $2.84 billion up 0.6%, representing a 9.2% operating margin for the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/02/ferguson-ferg-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FERG 2025 Q4","e":"ferg","d":"2025-09-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Bill Brundage","x":"We tightly managed operating expenses, benefiting from the streamlining actions we took earlier in the year while we continue to invest in core capabilities for future growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/02/ferguson-ferg-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FERG 2026 Q3","e":"ferg","d":"2026-11-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bill Brundage","x":"This was down 40 basis points over the prior year, which was expected due to the timing and extent of supplier price increases in the prior period.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/09/ferguson-ferg-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FERG 2026 Q3","e":"ferg","d":"2026-11-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kevin Murphy","x":"It remains to be seen what types of price increases will be announced from our manufacturers as we step into the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/09/ferguson-ferg-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FERG 2026 Q3","e":"ferg","d":"2026-11-09","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Kevin Murphy","x":"While our markets remain mixed, our year-to-date performance and the addition of FloWorks enabled us to raise our full year guidance, which Bill will cover in more detail.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/09/ferguson-ferg-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[59,1,6048,0,0,0,4913,776],[60,1,7997,0,0,0,6346,1379],[61,1,8196,0,0,0,6509,1436],[62,1,8981,0,0,0,7214,1538],[67,1,7056,0,0,0,5673,1113]],"cinema":[[59,1,6048,0,0,0,4913,776],[60,1,7997,0,0,0,6346,1379],[61,1,8196,0,0,0,6509,1436],[62,1,8981,0,0,0,7214,1538],[67,1,7056,0,0,0,5673,1113]],"imax":[[59,1,6048,0,0,0,4913,776],[60,1,7997,0,0,0,6346,1379],[61,1,8196,0,0,0,6509,1436],[62,1,8981,0,0,0,7214,1538],[67,1,7056,0,0,0,5673,1113]],"streaming":[[59,1,6048,0,0,0,4913,776],[60,1,7997,0,0,0,6346,1379],[61,1,8196,0,0,0,6509,1436],[62,1,8981,0,0,0,7214,1538],[67,1,7056,0,0,0,5673,1113]],"dtc":[[59,1,6048,0,0,0,4913,776],[60,1,7997,0,0,0,6346,1379],[61,1,8196,0,0,0,6509,1436],[62,1,8981,0,0,0,7214,1538],[67,1,7056,0,0,0,5673,1113]],"ai_spend":[[59,1,6048,0,0,0,4913,776],[60,1,7997,0,0,0,6346,1379],[61,1,8196,0,0,0,6509,1436],[62,1,8981,0,0,0,7214,1538],[67,1,7056,0,0,0,5673,1113]],"tariffs":[[59,1,6048,1,1,0,4913,776],[60,1,7997,12,8,4,6346,1379],[61,1,8196,11,8,3,6509,1436],[62,1,8981,4,2,2,7214,1538],[67,1,7056,0,0,0,5673,1113]],"pricing_power":[[59,1,6048,4,4,0,4913,776],[60,1,7997,13,8,5,6346,1379],[61,1,8196,12,7,5,6509,1436],[62,1,8981,7,6,1,7214,1538],[67,1,7056,3,3,0,5673,1113]],"cost_cuts":[[59,1,6048,3,3,0,4913,776],[60,1,7997,0,0,0,6346,1379],[61,1,8196,12,9,3,6509,1436],[62,1,8981,6,5,1,7214,1538],[67,1,7056,0,0,0,5673,1113]],"guidance":[[59,1,6048,0,0,0,491